# Model weights are not vendored. RVM's are GPL-3.0 (compatible, but large), and
# DeepFilterNet's have NO license grant at all — upstream issue #697 asks for one and
# is unanswered — which is exactly why we load them from a path at runtime instead of
# embedding them with include_bytes!.
/models/*.onnx
/models/*.tar.gz
